# SGD (Salesforce Git Delta) Ignore File
# This file is used by sfdx-git-delta to exclude metadata from delta deployments

# Specific problematic files
**/permissionsets/sfdcInternalInt__sfdc_slack.permissionset-meta.xml
**/flowDefinitions/r_Lead_After_Save.flowDefinition-meta.xml

# All Salesforce Internal/Managed Permission Sets
**/permissionsets/sfdcInternalInt__*
**/permissionsets/force__*

# All Profiles
**/profiles/**

# Experience Cloud Sites and Digital Experiences
**/sites/**
**/digitalExperiences/**
**/digitalExperienceConfigs/**
**/networks/**
**/siteDotComSites/**
**/digitalExperienceBundles/**
**/experienceBundles/**

# Dashboards with long paths
**/dashboards/**/*SPLIT*/**

# Other problematic metadata
**/flowDefinitions/**
**/installedPackages/**
